---
import { icons } from '../lib/icons';
import { appIcons } from '../lib/apps';
import { site } from '../lib/site';

---

<section class="section" id="new">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="pill-new">New in v0.8 and v0.9</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">More taskbar than ever.</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Maximized windows stop at the dock, the tray shows your keyboard language, microphone and notifications, and a quick launcher is one
        shortcut away. Plus new widgets, profiles that switch by themselves, web widgets from a link, far more devices in Device batteries and
        widgets on every display.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="news">
      <article class="nw nw-wide reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-ql">
            <div class="ql-box"><span class="ql-s" set:html={icons.search} /><span>term</span><i class="ql-caret"></i></div>
            <div class="ql-r on"><span class="ql-i" set:html={appIcons.terminal} /><span><b>Terminal</b><small>App</small></span></div>
            <div class="ql-r"><span class="ql-i ql-d" set:html={icons.settings} /><span><b>Turn on auto-hide</b><small>DockHub command</small></span></div>
            <div class="ql-r"><span class="ql-i ql-d" set:html={icons.copy} /><span><b>= 30</b><small>200*15% · Enter copies</small></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="keys-row">
            <kbd class="k k-win" set:html={icons.windows} /><span class="k-plus">+</span><kbd class="k">Alt</kbd><span class="k-plus">+</span><kbd class="k">Space</kbd>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>A quick launcher, Spotlight style.</h3>
          <p>
            Type to find apps, open windows, DockHub and Windows settings, recent files and dock commands. It does quick math too, and anything
            else is one Enter away from a web search. Open it with Win + Alt + Space, or make the search button open it. Try the search button in
            the demo above.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-max">
            <div class="mm-win"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="mm-gap"></div>
            <div class="mm-dock"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Maximized windows stop at the dock.</h3>
          <p>Just like the Windows taskbar, at every display scaling and on every screen with a dock. DockHub checks it after display and Explorer changes and repairs it by itself.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-tray">
            <span class="tr-ic tr-lang">TUR</span>
            <span class="tr-ic tr-mic" set:html={icons.mic} />
            <span class="tr-ic" set:html={icons.wifi} />
            <span class="tr-ic" set:html={icons.volume} />
            <span class="tr-clock">10:24<b>2</b></span>
            <span class="tr-tip">Microphone: on<small>In use by Teams · click to mute</small></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>A smarter tray.</h3>
          <p>Keyboard language (click or scroll to switch), a microphone icon you can click to mute, the number of waiting notifications and a moon while Do Not Disturb is on.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-profiles">
            <span class="mp"><i style="--c:var(--c-blue)"></i>Work</span>
            <span class="mp on"><i style="--c:var(--c-green)"></i>Gaming</span>
            <span class="mp"><i style="--c:var(--c-orange)"></i>Laptop</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-rules">
            <span><b>steam</b> is running → Gaming</span>
            <span>Weekdays 09:00 to 18:00 → Work</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Profiles that switch by themselves.</h3>
          <p>Bring in your gaming dock while a game runs, or your work dock during office hours. When the app closes or the hours end, DockHub goes back.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-widgets">
            <span style="--c:var(--c-green)">GPU</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-yellow)">Brightness</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-blue)">Wi-Fi &amp; Bluetooth</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-pink)">Screenshot</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-green)">To do · Todoist</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-orange)">Codex &amp; Gemini usage</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Five new widgets.</h3>
          <p>GPU load, screen brightness and night light, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth switches, one-click screenshots and today's tasks. AI usage now also tracks OpenAI Codex and Gemini CLI.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-peek">
            <div class="pk-thumb"><i></i><span>Report.docx</span></div>
            <div class="pk-thumb on"><i></i><span>Music</span><b set:html={icons.pause} /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-auto">Rest to peek · scroll to cycle · play/pause</div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Livelier previews.</h3>
          <p>Icons bounce while an app starts. In previews, rest on a thumbnail to peek at that window, scroll to cycle through windows, and pause music right there.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw nw-wide reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-link">
            <span class="ml-url">github.com/you/widgets/tree/main/pomodoro</span>
            <span class="mt-btn">Install</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-auto">Featured: <b>GitHub pull requests</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Web widgets from a link.</h3>
          <p>
            Paste a manifest.json, a .dockwidget file or a GitHub folder link. You see the permissions first. Featured widgets install in one click.{' '}
            <a href={site.sdkUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">SDK guide</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw nw-full nw-fixes reveal">
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>And in v0.9.</h3>
          <p>More devices, more displays, more languages, and v{site.version} fixes what you reported.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="fixes">
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Device batteries for far more gear.</b> Xbox and PlayStation controllers, Logitech, Razer, SteelSeries Arctis 7 and LAMZU mice, with a low battery warning.</span></li>
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Widgets on every display.</b> Put any widget on the dock of any screen.</span></li>
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>German and Spanish</b> next to English and Turkish.</span></li>
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Steadier, sharper, clearer.</b> Changing the design no longer moves your dock. v0.9.2 stops it closing by itself, sharpens icons on high-DPI screens and adds a Transparent backdrop for PCs where blur shows black.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="news-more reveal">
      <a class="btn btn-quiet" href={site.releaseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Full release notes<span class="btn-ic" set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pill-new {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 30px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgb(76 194 255 / 0.1);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(76 194 255 / 0.28);
  }
  .news {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .nw {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .nw > *,
  .nw-art > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .nw-full {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .nw-wide {
    grid-column: span 2;
    grid-template-rows: none;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .nw-copy h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .nw-copy p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .nw-copy a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .nw-art {
    min-height: 150px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 30% 0%, rgb(76 194 255 / 0.13), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03), rgb(255 255 255 / 0.01));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  .keys-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .k {
    min-width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font: 600 15px var(--font-ui);
    color: var(--text);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1), rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04));
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12),
      inset 0 -2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
  }
  .k-win :global(svg) {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .mt-btn {
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  /* profiles */
  .mock-profiles {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .mp {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .mp i {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
  }
  .mp.on {
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
  }
  .mock-auto {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .mock-auto b {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* tray */
  .mock-tray {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgb(28 30 38 / 0.85);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
    margin-top: 44px;
  }
  .tr-ic {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .tr-ic :global(svg) {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
  }
  .tr-vol {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .tr-tip {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: calc(100% + 8px);
    translate: -50% 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: rgb(44 46 54 / 0.97);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .tr-tip small {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  /* quick launcher */
  .mock-ql {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3px;
    width: min(100%, 340px);
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(32 34 42 / 0.94);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1),
      0 16px 34px -14px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .ql-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06);
    box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .ql-s,
  .ql-i {
    display: grid;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .ql-i {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }
  .ql-d {
    padding: 3px;
  }
  .ql-s :global(svg),
  .ql-i :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .ql-caret {
    width: 1px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--text);
    animation: ql-blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes ql-blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  .ql-r {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .ql-r span:last-child {
    display: grid;
  }
  .ql-r b {
    font-weight: 560;
  }
  .ql-r small {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .ql-r.on {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .k-plus {
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  /* maximized window */
  .mock-max {
    width: min(100%, 230px);
    height: 118px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 6px 26px;
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #3a4a7a, #1b2238);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .mm-win {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    border-radius: 5px 5px 2px 2px;
    background: rgb(240 242 248 / 0.92);
  }
  .mm-win i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);
  }
  .mm-gap {
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgb(76 194 255 / 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .mm-dock {
    margin-inline: 22px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgb(28 30 38 / 0.8);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
  }

  /* tray indicators */
  .tr-lang {
    width: auto;
    padding: 0 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .tr-mic {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .tr-clock {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0 6px 0 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .tr-clock b {
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    left: -3px;
    min-width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  /* profile rules */
  .mock-rules {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    justify-items: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .mock-rules b {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* new widgets */
  .mock-widgets {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    max-width: 300px;
  }
  .mock-widgets span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .mock-widgets span::before {
    content: '';
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
  }

  /* previews */
  .mock-peek {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .pk-thumb {
    position: relative;
    width: 96px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: rgb(36 38 46 / 0.9);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
  }
  .pk-thumb i {
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e9edf5, #b9c3d6);
  }
  .pk-thumb.on {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);
  }
  .pk-thumb.on i {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f7b267, #6a2c70);
  }
  .pk-thumb b {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    top: 26px;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #111;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
  }
  .pk-thumb b :global(svg) {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
  }

  /* link install */
  .mock-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: min(100%, 330px);
    padding: 6px 6px 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgb(36 38 46 / 0.92);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .ml-url {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font: 11.5px 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* fixes */
  .nw-fixes {
    grid-template-columns: none;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .fixes {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px 24px;
  }
  .fixes li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .fixes b {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .fx-ok {
    flex: none;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #062a12;
    background: var(--c-green);
  }
  .fx-ok :global(svg) {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
  }
  .news-more {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .news {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .nw-wide,
    .nw-full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .news {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .nw-wide,
    .nw-fixes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: none;
    }
    .fixes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .nw {
      padding: 16px;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ql-caret {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
